<title>USA: Allied Capital Corp II president resigns.</title>
<headline>Allied Capital Corp II president resigns.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Allied Capital Corp II said on Friday William Dunbar resigned as president and director of the company.</p>
<p>His successor, William Walton, was named president and portfolio manager of Allied Capital Corp II.</p>
<p>Walton is a past director of Allied Capital Corp and a current director of Allied Capital Advisers Inc, the investment adviser to the Allied Capital companies.</p>
<p>Dunbar resigned to to pursue other business opportunities, the company said.</p>
</text>
